**8. As a corrupter of idiom. That is** the capacity in which analogy chiefly
>>>

<<<
Understanding by idiom the way in which
===
Understanding by *idiom* the way in which
>>>

<<<
& by an idiom any particular combination of words, or pattern of

hrase, or construction, that has

me habitual with us to the exclusion of other possibilities, the pranks played by analogy upon idiom & idioms are innumerable. Of the following extracts each ex-
===
& by *an idiom* any particular combination of words, or pattern of phrase, or construction, that has become habitual with us to the exclusion of other possibilities, the pranks played by analogy upon idiom & idioms are innumerable. Of the following extracts each ex-
>>>

<<<
+ hibits an outrage upon idiom, & each is due to the assumption that some word or phrase amg treated in a way that would be legitimate if another of roughly the same meaning had been used instead; that other is given in a bracket, sometimes with alternative forms:—
