<<<
 They are capable of braving this consequence, but we not think the public need fear that they will do it for anything less than what they are honestly convinced to be a real necessity (they honestly believe to be).
===
 *They are capable of braving this consequence, but we do not think the public need fear that they will do it for anything less than what* they are honestly convinced to be *a real necessity* (they honestly believe to be).
>>>

